{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hjhUzEDXhEjIpDT7olpiyA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:47.576401+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/hjhUzEDXhEjIpDT7olpiyA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>化合自然 学微知章</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span><br/></span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>化学学院2026年</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>全国优秀大学生夏令营通知</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为进一步加强国内高校优秀本科生的学术交流，拓宽青年学子学术视野，激发学生投身化学科学研究的热情，发掘和选拔综合素质优异、科研潜力突出的优秀本科生，吸引更多有志深造的青年人才来我院攻读研究生，西安交通大学化学学院定于2026年暑期举办全国优秀大学生夏令营活动。</span></span></p><p><span><span>本次夏令营面向全国高校成绩优良、热爱化学事业、立志从事化学及相关领域科研工作的优秀本科生开放。活动期间将开展学院及化学优势学科建设情况介绍、各专业研究方向前沿进展分享、校园与科研实验室实地参观、学术报告研讨、师生面对面座谈交流等系列活动，为广大学子搭建了解我院学科实力、科研平台与研究生培养体系的优质平台。本次夏令营计划招收营员70名，相关申请工作即日起正式启动，具体事宜通知如下：</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ibkvu5vDFB1MwkoXfBRvXA5wD2l5ybwd6sgv6D2f5iaam7pDKsO3dkE3GvaLt914IFoJx7rDbL34Hk10b9CfvwNoCIuic0B0ff8OekbficzUAMI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月17日-7月19日（具体安排另行通知）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ibkvu5vDFB1NTXfMKDLwB8J3fgQCSQ3Y5alCU49WLHicD0ZsPDL7tMtBwCWnORAjiaTgbh0UaSnzSwoEe9wIwHopgZ8so5nxibu6fIyKlMdMgNI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.政治态度端正，思想意识健康，遵纪守法，诚实守信，学风端正，品行优良，无任何学术不端行为记录，无任何违纪行为记录；</span></p><p><span>2.化学及相关专业三年级学生（2027年应届毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>3.材料工程专业偏化学方向三年级学生（2027年应届毕业生）；</span></p><p><span>4.对化学有浓厚的兴趣，学习成绩优异。有志于从事化学研究工作，并有较强或潜在科研能力。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibkvu5vDFB1N0pRLxE1YSnibdZsuAvQicbhXGcicKia1uOan2CiajibibVU6sNwm6RkQFhkIia4tYiaXox1SoiaAaLpibfgVoK1KDO3eZX67mibj94cYjyO8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1．本科成绩单（需加盖教务处公章）；</span></p><p><span>2．英语四级、六级证书复印件或其他外语水平证明材料；</span></p><p><span>3．其它能够反映自己学术水平或研究潜力的材料；</span></p><p><span>4．请将上述申请材料按顺序扫描成PDF文档，上传至报名系统。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ibkvu5vDFB1O7JsIOoLribcu7020icicnzXoUuDnkwvuanBUw6VMBaiceLhVfQeEicWL3kmNfZ1hIuh7fMUxrrD9mic1LK1Xt5AEuicIA2uESepCFVc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1．系统报名：</span></p><p><span><span>学生登录夏令营报名系统（http://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn/），报名项目选择“全国优秀大学生夏令营”，注册获取报名号，用报名号重新登录后，阅读查看学院夏令营相关规定，并填写报名信息、上传相关材料后保存、提交，等待学院审核。可在报名页面查看报名审核通过与否、确认是否参加及查看夏令营营员等级等。</span></span></p><p><span>2．报名时间：2026年6月1日至2026年6月18日。</span></p><p><span>3．资格审核工作将于6月30日前结束，审核结果通过系统公布。届时未接到通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。（未在规定时间内在系统上确认是否入营的同学，视为自动放弃）</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibkvu5vDFB1PWNdNXmI0H1eHnTEbbsTTia9Y3aJKj43p3HtCWOtXmq51fv9ABfuiaOaGrMBvLy87ndibVBicTGYObdia0ly16ibQxqo6XshJeFibsx4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>资助标准</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>资格审核通过的学生，学校将统一安排食宿，</span><strong><span>往返交通费自理</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ibkvu5vDFB1OZUek0c8rFYIQ0F9mgrYw9sUQGLStNdZbmeZM54xp2nSlSiaMqCHYiaHWYoBOoM8tFXoviaRQnDW6iaicibjrc0CB6CkbYiayKEyB3IE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1．学生须承诺所有申报材料和信息均属实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消本人参营资格。</span></p><p><span>2．参加夏令营的学生应服从夏令营组织者的安排，按时参加活动。夏令营期间必须遵守夏令营的各项规章制度。</span></p><p><span>3．夏令营期间，学生安全由其本人负责。</span></p><p><span>4.  夏令营具体活动安排另行通知，请及时关注化学学院官网。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibkvu5vDFB1PGhFJ7s7QViaKpUHCeFVLwS9saKJlibHNuvr3EhLLFDCrJFc1icTm5KDDEfX0FN6kD4UH8ia4TR4CeZHlicL3ZVgO2egYgaccJibHbo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>地址：陕西省西安市中国西部科技创新港19号楼泓润楼化学学院</span></p><p><span>网址：http://chem.xjtu.edu.cn/</span></p><p><span>联系人：杨老师、陈老师</span></p><p><span>电话：029-88963916</span></p><p><span><span>E-mail: yangxinyue@xjtu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span>QQ群：399959090    2026化学学院夏令营</span></p><p><span>我们诚挚欢迎有志于从事化学研究的同学踊跃报名，如有任何疑问，可通过电话和email进行咨询。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibkvu5vDFB1MLlCicKwqyQv1vWlm6DHlOQyRnnErVMW86rtexP1rnNwU7Qu36evlaguQE2J9lH7RwKEJD0mjV1J7QU7uMvGp02arelVk6EoIA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>微信公众号丨</span></span></strong><span><span>西安交大化学学院</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>编辑丨</span></span></strong><span><span>院研会宣传部 李阳逸</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>审核丨</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>段新华 陈玲玲</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"4fd3402966871acece8ea4e15a6885f1d812f4f2ce4f43e6d2304480109a70a1","textLength":1314,"sourceSha256":"758d9a0f7b7fd4036a84319fa796059c9042fdaf98e8ff3870b9c0e96f8278cc","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0e1e8d4393b3aa3acf66","title":"2026年西安交通大学化学学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:47.576401+00:00"}
